tantiport is a full-text search engine built on Tantivy, for use as an
Erlang or Elixir port.

With --jsonl it speaks a versioned request protocol: documents with an
id, a grouping key, a title, a text and JSON metadata are added,
replaced, deleted, listed and searched, and every change is committed
before it is acknowledged. jsonl_port is the Elixir client for that
protocol. Without --jsonl it runs a small search demo.
